; A duplicate open is an error, and one after a close makes the account
; active again: beancount adds the account of every open to its active set.
; The posting between the close and the second open is to an inactive
; account; the one after it is not. A close after that is a duplicate too,
; and still closes the account.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2020-01-01 open Equity:E
2020-01-05 close Assets:Cash

2022-01-01 * "between the close and the second open"
  Assets:Cash  1 USD
  Equity:E

2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash

2024-01-02 * "after the second open"
  Assets:Cash  1 USD
  Equity:E

2024-01-03 close Assets:Cash

2024-01-04 * "after the second close"
  Assets:Cash  1 USD
  Equity:E
